<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila firm buys 7,500T U.S. wheat-traders.</title>
<headline>Manila firm buys 7,500T U.S. wheat-traders.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Philippine firm bought 7,500 tonnes of western white wheat from a Japanese commodity house, traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The deal is for November shipment,&quot; one trader told Reuters.</p>
<p>Further details of the transaction were not immediately available.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
